# ── Secrets & environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The deploy/ folder holds the real (sensitive) config that is copied into place
# by hand at deploy time — it must NEVER be committed. See deployment.txt.
/deploy/
webapp/.env
.env
*.env

# Generated agent-side scripts (Configuration > Scripts). Only the generated/ SUBFOLDER —
# configuration/ itself holds committed reference samples (see its README). Ignored for the
# same reason deploy/ is: these are rendered per host with real paths, and any carrying a
# credential would carry it in plaintext. The DEFINITIONS live in the database; the templates
# they are rendered from are committed under webapp/reports/script_templates/.
/configuration/generated/

# Real runtime config that lives at these paths once deployed (samples ARE committed):
/send_report/config.ini
/prometheus.yml
/standalone/systems admin report/config.ini
/send_report/backup_policy.json

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Django ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal
/webapp/staticfiles/
*.log

# ── OS / editor / misc dev artefacts ──────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.xlsx
*.png
!webapp/static/img/logo.png
# role-selection tile icons — real app assets, not dev artefacts
!webapp/static/img/roles/*.png
!send_report/logo.png
!standalone/systems admin report/logo.png
# The header mark is a SHIPPED asset, not a screenshot: without it the deployed app has no
# manifest entry for it and the header breaks. Same for the design references it came from.
!webapp/static/img/brand-mark.png
# The application's own mark (the kingfisher) and the favicon built from it.
!webapp/static/img/reports/*.png
!webapp/static/img/app-mark.png
!webapp/static/img/favicon.png
# ...and the source art it was cut from.
!icons/application/*.jpg
!webapp/design-assets/*.png
# Platform glyphs for the system pickers. SHIPPED assets for the same reason as the header
# mark: app.css masks them by url(), so collectstatic fails outright if they aren't committed.
!webapp/static/img/os/*.png
# Role glyphs for the Role Select tiles. SHIPPED assets: the picker renders them by <img>,
# so without them every tile on the first screen after sign-in is a broken image.
!webapp/static/img/roles/*.png
Screenshot*.png
example.png
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
